# Family Catering Order System — Core Context

Replacing a manual WhatsApp + Excel order-intake process for a small
family catering business. Two surfaces: a public free-text order form
for customers, and an admin dashboard for Dad (non-technical) showing
raw + structured order data with CSV export.

Full context: @../../.ai/project-brief.md
Engineering standards and non-negotiables: @../../.ai/engineering.md
Order parsing contract: @../../.ai/order-parsing.md

Non-negotiables (do not violate these under any circumstance):
1. Raw customer order text is never overwritten or deleted.
2. The parser never invents order items — uncertainty routes to manual
   review, never a guess.
3. Money is integer cents or Decimal, never float.
4. Timezones are explicit — UTC stored, local time displayed.
5. Admin auth method is an open decision — don't assume it.
